                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cd22099d-81f0-35bf-b42c-7b5ceaffaeb2",
                        "entry_id": "21f277c0-406a-3109-9812-024e683523b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A property of a fluid flow related to local angular rotation; defined as the curl of the flow's velocity field."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "131b8106-e056-4ec8-b39a-989afd992785",
                                "sense_id": "cd22099d-81f0-35bf-b42c-7b5ceaffaeb2",
                                "text": "It might sound puzzling that the ageostrophic geopotential (or the ageostrophic pressure in z-coordinate) has no impact on the evolution of the vorticity of a quasi-geostrophic disturbance and yet it affects the perturbation kinetic energetics (not globally but locally)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4283b72-9b27-4073-822f-2482e4103624",
                                "sense_id": "cd22099d-81f0-35bf-b42c-7b5ceaffaeb2",
                                "text": "This results from the vorticity component of shear, whereas elongated cells would further be affected by the rate of strain component."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0217f49-6d94-4b41-bc82-93d2f72d9b18",
                                "sense_id": "cd22099d-81f0-35bf-b42c-7b5ceaffaeb2",
                                "text": "An extreme version of vorticity is a vortex. The vortex is a spinning, cyclonic mass of fluid, which can be observed in the rotation of water going down a drain, as well as in smoke rings, tornados and hurricanes."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
